    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "Student needs to connect the graph to the impulse-momentum theorem. Use a relatable analogy (taxi braking) to explain how force over time changes momentum. Ask a diagnostic question about the slope and the target variable. [TOOL CHECK: calculator(expression=\"(4.5 - 0) / (0.03 - 0.01)\") -> 225.0]",
